Third-party code in src/port/x86_64
===================================

Four files in this folder are copied byte for byte from FreeBSD and are not
changed: memcpy.S, memmove.S, memset.S and memcmp.S. They keep their names
and their notices. The other files are libterae's own, carry libterae's
notice, and adapt them: port_memcpy.S, port_memmove.S, port_memset.S and
port_memcmp.S, which are the files assembled, and amd64_archlevel.h,
machine/asm.h and machine/param.h, which stand in for FreeBSD's headers of
the same names. No FreeBSD header is used.

Project:    FreeBSD
Repository: https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src
Commit:     2321b3df1f0db4f839cb9dde7c0a9a0060d4bcfe

